      "side": 1,
      "message": "Most other module types handle invert these semantics, instead of guessing the type from the extension they don\u0027t specify the extension in the Android.bp file and let the Go code choose the appropriate extension.  That generally means using ctx.BaseModuleName() as the file name, with the `stem:` property to override it, and then boolean properties for `xml`, `html`, and `gzip`.",
