      "lineNbr": 47,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-18T19:48:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s why I\u0027m suggesting the blueprint file doesn\u0027t specify the extension.  The output filename will be `\u003cstem\u003e(.txt|.xml|.html)(.gz)?` based on the properties.  The current system seems error prone, for example I think the current implementation would produce a text notice file for `.htm.gz`.",
      "parentUuid": "fdd4ff70_66a57249",
      "revId": "5db7e0d4435bcc8e163dfeb70343f1596f650395",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
